{"id":"vod_sn_38970","vodId":"38970","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"牙狼 炎之刻印","name_cn":"牙狼 炎之刻印","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6a50848b834d88d2cfa9767f2338bc24.jpg"},"summary":"该片讲述了国王身边的人投奔了大规模的“狩猎魔女”，并将有着守护之命的魔戒骑士和魔戒法师们杀害。其中的一个魔戒法师，在被处以火刑的当口产下了一个孩子，那是继承了黄金骑士血脉的后代。身为魔戒骑士的父亲救下了这个孩子——莱昂·刘易斯。随着他成长为一个少年，他也承接下了黄金之铠 甲。如今国家的实权掌握在了国王身边的恶人手里，而身为国王的父亲重病在床，王子阿方索同母亲一起被赶了出来。为了重夺王权，拯救苍生，王子开始了搜寻传说中的黄金骑士的旅途。莱昂与阿方索，围绕着两个少年的故事就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yuqtpq9R4z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sTfn2Ea95Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H6qVjZhCgE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uYTGX1s38X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aT8mGQBXe91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jJthLZTCqF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yXNespfc9j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X2bqHrhmaR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pnGrgyPw441/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c5wM64CfB41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QddWGZQgZZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xPbDAftmQ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iaTKd9SFLM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2v2GyATuWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P6